  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roads for Development - R4D</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implemented from March 2012 to December 2022, the Road for Development Support Program (R4D-SP) was designed to support the Government of Timor-Leste&#x2019;s R4D program. R4D-SP reflects the joint development priorities of the GoTL and Government of Australia to provide rural Timor-Leste with a functioning and appropriate rural road network. The principal development goal for the R4D-SP was &#x201c;Women and men in rural Timor-Leste are deriving social and economic benefits from improved rural road access&#x201d;.</narrative>
  </description>
